(1. Who was the Commander-in-Chief of the Mukti Bahini?) Tj T*
(A\) Colonel M. A. G. Osmani B\) Major Ziaur Rahman C\) Khaled Mosharraf D\) K. M. Shafiullah) Tj T*
(Answer: A) Tj T*
(Explanation: General M. A. G. Osmani served as Commander-in-Chief of the liberation forces.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. In which year did Bangladesh become a member of the United Nations?) Tj T*
(A\) 1972 B\) 1974 C\) 1975 D\) 1971) Tj T*
(Answer: B) Tj T*
(Explanation: Bangladesh joined as the 136th member on 17 September 1974.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Which protocol is used to transfer email between mail servers?) Tj T*
(A\) SMTP B\) POP3 C\) IMAP D\) FTP) Tj T*
(Answer: A) Tj T*
